  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><span style=\"color:#f00\">ОБЯЗАТЕЛЬНО ИСПОЛЬЗОВАНИЕ OPTIFINE</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#000\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">Переработка модели Виттера, основанная на концепциях и сюжетной линии модпака <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/rebirth-of-the-night\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rebirth of the Night.</a></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/644/115/wither_rotn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"911\" height=\"511\"></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/644/112/satisfaction.png\"></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#c9f\"><span style=\"color:#000\">Версия 2.1 (можно продолжать использовать, если предпочитаете)</span></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/355885961630187530/929496958614257695/Sin_titulo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"922\" height=\"569\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/716900982558031932/763993289077948456/A_dark_timeline.png?width=561&amp;height=702\" alt=\"\" width=\"561\" height=\"702\"></span></span></p></div><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>",
